            "text": "As a shopper in Sydney, New South Wales, looking for an Australian candy gift box, you have several excellent options that offer delivery right to your door.\n\nHere are some highly-rated recommendations:\n\n*   **Dessert Boxes** offers a range of candy collection boxes that can be delivered across Australia, including same-day delivery for birthday dessert boxes in Sydney. You can also customise these boxes and add a personal touch with the recipient's name.\n*   **Edible Blooms** provides beautifully curated hampers and dessert boxes with reliable delivery services. If you order before 3:00 PM AEST, you can get same-day delivery within Sydney, and next-day delivery to outer Sydney metro areas. Edible Blooms was also recognised as the #1 Online Gift Delivery Company for Australia by Canstar in 2022.\n*   **All Boxed Out AU** specialises in dessert gift boxes and offers same-day delivery within Sydney for orders placed before 10 am. They have \"Large - Lolly Box\" and \"Medium - Lolly Box\" options.\n*   **Lollylicious** is a family-run Australian business that creates handcrafted chocolate and lolly bouquets and hampers, delivering to NSW. They focus on unique designs using quality products.\n*   **Sticky** offers an \"Aussie Favourites Gift Box\" which includes their own hard candy alongside other popular Australian lollies like Musk Sticks and Australian Liquorice.\n*   **The Chocolate Box** has been crafting indulgent moments since 1958, offering a variety of fine Australian chocolate gift boxes and hampers with Australia-wide delivery. Their range includes popular favourites like coconut roughs, peanut clusters, and raspberry jellies.\n*   **Lollygraze**, an Adelaide-based online store, also delivers their lolly gift boxes to Sydney, putting \"lots of love and careful attention into each Lolly Gift Box/Candy Box.\"\n*   **iCandy Sydney** provides pick & mix candy boxes. They offer local delivery within the Hills District of Sydney (free within a 10km radius of Stanhope Gardens) and also ship Australia-wide via Australia Post.\n*   **Lolly Kingdom** is another Australian online candy store that offers a selection of lolly boxes, including pick-n-mix varieties.\n\nWhen choosing, consider factors like customisation options, delivery speed, and the specific types of Australian candies you're looking for to ensure the perfect gift."
          }
